Third-party data
----------------
The file vision_detect/data/coco_person_subset.json is a subset of bounding-box
annotations from COCO 2017.

Annotations: Copyright COCO Consortium, Creative Commons Attribution 4.0.
https://cocodataset.org/
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

Cite: Tsung-Yi Lin, Michael Maire, Serge Belongie, James Hays, Pietro Perona,
Deva Ramanan, Piotr Dollár, and C. Lawrence Zitnick. Microsoft COCO: Common
Objects in Context. European Conference on Computer Vision, 2014.

Images referenced by that file are not included. Each image keeps the Flickr
license recorded on its entry. Sample photos committed under web/samples and
docs/predictions were limited to records whose license allows redistribution
and derivatives, and they are credited beside the images.
